Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.82,0:00:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, God damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.62,0:00:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This frickin' pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.06,0:00:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd the damn thing go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angelo Katagiri, a .k .a. Angelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Known as the sickest, most heinous\Ncriminal in Japanese history.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He continually murdered from the age\Nof 12, with his final homicide being...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Milkman!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.43,0:00:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch where you step!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fouler than dog shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In March of 1994,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.44,0:00:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he came across three\Nunsuspecting 14-year-old boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two of which the monster\Nproceeded to rape and murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.86,0:00:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You step in something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I suppose I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what frickin' pisses me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People letting their dog\Nshit in my yard like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have half a mind to keep\Nit dumping it in the owner's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:01:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pocket tomorrow morning sounds\Nlike fair game to me Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left your milk sitting\Nright over there later then
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.02,0:01:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've seen\Nyou around here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.74,0:01:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh Yeah, i'm just temping for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.38,0:01:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The third boy came from an extremely\Nwealthy family so angelo demanded ransom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.88,0:01:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what led to his arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.40,0:01:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I hate to nitpick, Temp Guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the safety seal on this\Nbottle is clearly broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's so. Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right here, plain as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.10,0:01:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you it was broken. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.36,0:01:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks again for the milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.02,0:01:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.82,0:01:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse that damn bitch!
