Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.62,0:01:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one sure is a sharp-eyed vixen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only that shrew and her punk\Nson Josuke had drunk the milk,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:02:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my stand aqua necklace would have been\Nin perfect position to conquer those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you have more\Nin there, you little shitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.40,0:02:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the police finally raided Angelo's\Ntorture den, they found a horrific sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boy had already been murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.70,0:02:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His genitalia severed and nailed to\Na pillar that was standing nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.42,0:02:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worthless bastard don't you know how to\Npick up after your dog and you just had
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to toss your dirty cig on the ground\Nwell you got what you deserved shitface?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.56,0:02:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna be a pompous asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:02:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you could swallow my stand\Nand die like the dirty rat you are!
