Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.37,0:04:32.29,Title Part 4 Episode 2,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(614,646)\pos(132,873)\fs60}Episode 2: {\fs80} Higashikata Josuke Meets Angelo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End My hair today, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand may not be very strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he can control it\Nfrom afar and its ability
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to infiltrate bodies is\Ngonna make things tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:04:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.81,0:05:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean until I get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't eat or drink anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away from tap water and avoid\Nthe bathroom and shower. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we slow down a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't exactly told\Nmy mom that you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,town yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.07,0:05:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's as tough as they\Ncome, but the thought of Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar can still make her cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.14,0:05:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she loves him\Neven after all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One look at you and she'll\Nknow exactly who you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.23,0:05:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke, where'd you get this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Milkman from this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand is already inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.26,0:05:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was hiding in my mom's coffee\Nand now it's crawled into her mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.30,0:05:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Josuke, do you want some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, that sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take milk and\Nsugar if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Milk and sugar it is.
