Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke, you said\Nmilk and sugar, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.31,0:06:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back, Mr. Jotaro. Still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I managed to catch the\Nlittle bastard, but... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what to do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.44,0:06:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.94,0:06:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angelo's probably spying\Non your house as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes glued to the\Nstand and I'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.30,0:06:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angelo was only able to\Nsurvive his execution and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.14,0:06:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,break out of prison because\Nhe had use of a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.86,0:06:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, I don't know the full\Nextent of his abilities.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.97,0:06:53.39,Episode 2 Typesetting 3 (Baseball),sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(1682.8,740.629)}Bottom of the 9th
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dead ball, sayonara!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:06:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dead ball, game over, sayonara!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna smash your prissy face and\Nrip your smoking hot mom to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to get that cap\Noff, or maybe I can break the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.98,0:07:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higashkata.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that name was familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I've stumbled upon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Officer Higashkata's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.22,0:07:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last time I saw him, I was just twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know everything there is\Nto know about you, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.22,0:07:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, weren't you\Nsupposed to go to class?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gramps, since when did they let\Nyou take guns home from work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:07:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.49,0:08:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.41,0:08:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just meeting up with\Nsomeone before I leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You goober, this is\Nonly a toy gun, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.28,0:08:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had you going, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that means the first win of this\Nweek goes to me yeah yeah real funny
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you win hmm what's wrong you don't\Nusually take it on the chin like that fine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.28,0:08:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and mom left for the day now shouldn't\Nyou be in bed you must be exhausted
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for our next story in a gruesome chain\Nof horrific incidents the death count
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has risen to seven in all cases the\Nvictims eyes and ears were disfigured
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the incident seems to be isolated to\Nthe town of Mariah but the police aren't
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sure whether the trauma is caused by\Ndisease or aggressive behavior i've
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,encountered this before my gut tells me\Nthese occurrences are undeniably deliberate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.38,0:08:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i hope it's not as bad\Nas i think but make no
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mistake something wicked's\Nlurking in this town
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:08:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grandpa
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know all of your quirks, Higashikata,\Nincluding what you drink after work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.10,0:09:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I recall, your drink of choice\Nis a nice cognac, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, grab the bottle\Nand get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take it where no one\Nwill be able to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.32,0:09:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just gay he gots guitar\Nyou really blew it kiddo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You turned your back on the old geezer, and\Nnow he's paid the ultimate price for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:10:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what happens\Nwhen you get cocky punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.38,0:10:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.38,0:10:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's nothing quite like the\Nfeeling of bringing a pretentious
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bastard crashing down to\Nearth in a puddle of despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.64,0:10:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You almost got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.34,0:10:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But almost isn't gonna cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to this world,\Ncause you're a dead man walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I turned away for one second\Nand he opened the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.12,0:10:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.08,0:10:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it doesn't look good,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but after my stand heals him,\Nit'll be like it never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There. All better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:10:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way that he's…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait, he's going to open his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.96,0:11:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand has always been\Nable to heal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.12,0:11:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done it so many\Ntimes, I've lost track.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.54,0:11:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fixed my friend's bones\Nlike it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Grandpa, quit\Nmessing around, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've already\Npassed out from last night's shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough with the jokes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.54,0:11:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa! Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.56,0:11:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's healed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.00,0:11:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.56,0:11:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's said the human organism\Nmust destroy in order to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.22,0:11:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your power is an unparalleled\Nact of compassion in a brutal world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is, no amount of compassion\Nor love can bring back the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even stands have\Nthat power. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My grandfather looked after\Nthis town for 35 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.78,0:12:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never once abandoned his post.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told me the danger\Nwas lurking as soon as he
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heard the news report\Nabout Angelo's return to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.14,0:12:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I looked into his eyes and saw\Na man of honor ready to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.78,0:12:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angelo's racked up a high body count.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are probably more victims out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.80,0:12:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just waiting to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He kills without motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.74,0:12:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Murdering for the thrill of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is only the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm certain that he'll keep killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first he'll kill you and your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.36,0:12:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take the baton my grandpa left\Nbehind, to protect my mom and the town,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.74,0:13:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and nothing's going to\Nget in the way of that.
