Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eventually, even these\Nbelongings would be discarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For despite his daughter's\Nreluctance to part
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a single one of\Nher cherished mementos,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his possessions would\Nnever be worn by him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to be there for him, but I'm\Nsure he needs his privacy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch anything that's\Nnot from a bottle or can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.34,0:14:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did your mom go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked her to go and visit some\Nof our relatives after the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.32,0:14:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can return after we make Angelo pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you say anything, I'm doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got a little worked\Nup hearing his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.58,0:14:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I've never\Nbeen calmer in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimately,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.05,0:14:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's your house, so I suppose you can\Ntake out your anger on whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.60,0:14:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, about that\Nscratch on your lip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did that when I punched you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.22,0:14:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't your stand possess the\Nability to heal your own wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be great, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no, it can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if his stand is\Nsomehow able to infiltrate
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.36,0:14:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your body and then tries\Nto eat its way out of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:14:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he gets me, I'm a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're planning, but\Nmy stand's not going back in that bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've already played your hand, so I'm\None step ahead of the game, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your efforts are futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.74,0:15:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got all the time in the world, so\Nhole up in there as long as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.36,0:15:30.45,Episode 2 Typesetting 1,sign,0,0,0,,{\be0.2\fad(338,521)\pos(964,770)}— 3 Days Later —
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.94,0:15:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bastard's been sniffing around\Nhere right under our noses, and still,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he hasn't moved on us in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.88,0:15:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's he waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raining? Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.49,0:16:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you were a weird one, but I\Ndidn't think you'd be a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.92,0:16:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My moment has finally arrived,\Ncause this house belongs to me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thanks to this rain,\Nyou're not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the looks of things, he must\Nhave gotten all this water boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even turned on the\Nhot water faucets, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make matters worse,\Nhis stand is in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out he hasn't been waiting\Nfor us to drink the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.88,0:16:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been waiting for the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.26,0:16:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand can move anywhere in the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can change\Nbetween liquid and vapor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.82,0:16:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, hurry and get\Naway from the kettle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:17:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He morphed into steam!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.76,0:17:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things just got a lot more difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't catch him with\Nthe bottle anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, stay away from any\Nsteam and protect your lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.78,0:17:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The priority is getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure we have much of a choice\Nas far as leaving is concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.36,0:17:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, Angelo's already put a bunch of\Nholes in the roof to make his job easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upstairs is no good, and we'll be\Nsitting ducks if we go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.64,0:17:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to be honest with\Nyou this liquid morphing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.36,0:17:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stand is way more than\NI bargained for plus!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really freaky he's a clever bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.80,0:18:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's so funny the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.28,0:18:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,son of a bitch has?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cornered us hey it's fine mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro my grandpa's murder\Nhas been kind enough to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn himself in it's pretty\Ngreat don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay it's time to finish
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them once and for all
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all ears
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.57,0:18:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke if
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.49,0:18:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have a plan now's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.40,0:18:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the time how do we get\Nout of this get out huh
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,getting out isn't exactly\Nwhat I had in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breaking out works better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:18:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wall's gonna repair itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.04,0:19:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we blocked the steam at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.74,0:19:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The humidifier!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I predicted that you'd break through the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wall and flee into this\Nroom seeking shelter!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.78,0:19:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.90,0:19:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's like picking\Nall the right answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.82,0:19:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I should compare\Nit to winning at the races.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.81,0:19:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can't help but let out a little\Ngiggle when you end up being the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.76,0:19:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That euphoria is one of the\Nbest feelings in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.20,0:19:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angelo thinks he's won,\Nbut he's got it wrong, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When this battle goes\Nthe way I know it will,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can promise you I won't feel\Nlike laughing in the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not when I'm fighting a\Nhorrible person like Angelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.16,0:20:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of gross though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.84,0:20:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cut a rubber glove into little\Npieces and swallowed it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.80,0:20:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.24,0:20:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we know where Angelo is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.92,0:20:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.48,0:20:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.18,0:20:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Angelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.72,0:20:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw the both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy now I don't know what you're thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.86,0:20:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you can't be serious about killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay I admit it I escaped that hellhole\Ncalled death row and sure I may have been
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.82,0:20:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,found guilty Under Japanese law but you\Nguys have no right to do anything to me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:21:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke let's be frank yeah I murdered\Nyour grandpa but that doesn't mean you can
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.62,0:21:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,put me to death too if you kill me you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.04,0:21:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll end up cursed\Njust like yours truly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.30,0:21:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So back off if you know\Nwhat's good for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.58,0:21:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's rude to point your finger at people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't your mother ever teach you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.72,0:21:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.70,0:21:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should take solace in the\Nfact no one's gonna execute you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.94,0:21:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not me, and not this guy either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.74,0:21:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't be killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.60,0:21:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nor will we be turning\Nyou into the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.56,0:21:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, you handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you psychotic\Nbastards planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your eternal penance, Angelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.82,0:21:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reflect on the life you stole from\Nmy grandpa and all the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.24,0:21:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you'll remain for all eternity\Nin the town my grandpa loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angelo's Rock,
