Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.98,0:22:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For years, it's charmed the residents of\NMorioh, despite its disturbing appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, this kid is batshit crazy.
